@node Agent Commands
@section Agent Commands
@cindex agent commands

Agent commands are bound under the @kbd{a} prefix in list and show
buffers, and the full menu is on @kbd{a} in the dispatch menu
(@pxref{Transients}).

@table @kbd
@item a t
Start a task agent.
@item a r
Start a review agent.
@item a p
Start a plan agent.
@item a q
Start a QA agent.
@item a c
Start a custom agent.
@item a x
Stop the agent at point.
@item a j
Jump to the agent buffer.
@item a a
Start the generic agent at point.
@end table

